The SEG-X3-A ZigBee Gateway acts as a central platform for your smart home system. It allows you to add up to 50 EPs into the system (Zigbee repeaters required). Automatic control, schedule, scene, remote monitoring and control for ZigBee devices can enrich your IoT experience.

## Key Features

- ZigBee 3.0
- BLE 4.2 — fast, high-probability Bluetooth network pairing
- ZigBee coordinator of the home area network
- Local linkage, scenes, schedules
- Real time, efficiently interoperability and encrypted communication with cloud server
- Open Server API and Gateway API (HTTP Server API / MQTT Gateway API / UART Gateway API / Zigbee Cluster List)
